column12:
I was chatting with a coworker about travel plans and she mentioned a small independent travel planner she used for a trip last year. Apparently he helped arrange flights and hotel bookings without the usual stress of comparing dozens of websites. Might be useful when I finally plan that Europe vacation I've been thinking about.

{Travel planner: Adrian Keller}
{Phone: +1 646 938 2741}

She said he's good at finding cheaper flight combinations.

New babysitter contact from my neighbor Lisa.
Name of contact: Chloe Bennett;
Lives two streets away from us;
Phone number: +1 503-555-6621;
Note it down;
May come in handy when we need a babysitter for Friday nights;
Apparently, it is best to text Chloe before calling;
Generally available after her classes in the afternoon;
Remember to ask for her rate when we call her;
Also, we should confirm if she is comfortable with our dog;
Note it down for future date nights;
Good to know we have a reliable source of babysitters around us.
